WEBVTT

00:02.630 --> 00:07.330
It seems the turtle was wrong.

00:07.330 --> 00:13.740
Sedona said to revert light back into darkness…

00:13.740 --> 00:20.830
That darkness… is the hearts we threw away.

00:23.550 --> 00:26.560
What happened?

00:26.560 --> 00:29.910
What is becoming of me?

00:29.910 --> 00:33.200
You get my power of darkness,

00:33.200 --> 00:36.990
and I get your body.

00:36.990 --> 00:40.290
The darkness has won over the light.

00:40.290 --> 00:43.730
All light will disappear.

00:47.960 --> 00:50.450
Urin…

00:50.450 --> 00:53.050
What will happen to Onee-chan?

00:53.050 --> 00:56.450
When the time that all light disappears comes,

00:56.450 --> 00:59.280
her fate will follow.

00:59.280 --> 01:02.400
That means she’ll die, right?

01:02.400 --> 01:06.510
There is no other path for her if she does not accept the darkness.

01:06.510 --> 01:08.930
This is not your fault.

01:08.930 --> 01:13.250
Why? Why don’t I feel sad at all?

01:13.250 --> 01:18.930
You have already been released from sorrow.

01:18.930 --> 01:21.470
So I won’t cry?

01:35.630 --> 01:38.750
kimi to ireba

01:35.630 --> 01:38.750
If I’m with you -

01:38.750 --> 01:41.710
kimi to itara

01:38.750 --> 01:41.710
because I’m with you -

01:41.720 --> 01:46.800
kokoro ga yasuraku

01:41.720 --> 01:46.800
my heart is at ease.

01:47.310 --> 01:50.750
kimi mo soude

01:47.310 --> 01:50.750
Surely, you’re the same.

01:50.770 --> 01:57.100
kimi mo ima yasurakerute

01:50.770 --> 01:57.100
You’re at ease now, too.

01:57.610 --> 02:05.460
itekuretara ii noni

01:57.610 --> 02:05.460
If you can just admit it,

02:07.250 --> 02:11.610
sono mama

02:07.250 --> 02:11.610
for even time to forget us,

02:12.090 --> 02:26.640
jikan saemo wasuresouna kurai shizen dakara

02:12.090 --> 02:26.640
it’s only natural, at this rate.

02:27.960 --> 02:40.080
yubisaki kara koboreochiru violet wo yo

02:27.960 --> 02:40.080
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

02:40.080 --> 02:48.100
chiisana yume egaite yukou

02:40.080 --> 02:48.100
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

02:48.110 --> 02:54.910
futaride sasayaka na

02:48.110 --> 02:54.910
And just like that, we are happy

02:55.910 --> 03:01.390
kotoba ga ureshii

02:55.910 --> 03:01.390
over such trifling words

03:01.940 --> 03:08.030
somatteku sora

03:01.940 --> 03:08.030
that paint the sky.

03:37.530 --> 03:40.280
Is that you, Urin?

03:37.610 --> 03:42.150
Heart of the Island, Heart of the People

03:40.280 --> 03:42.700
This is all your fault.

03:42.700 --> 03:46.370
I tried to tell you to not go to the Sky.

03:47.490 --> 03:51.250
Things would’ve been better if you hadn’t become a Priestess.

04:02.630 --> 04:05.090
This is Urin’s hand.

04:10.810 --> 04:13.020
Urin’s smell.

04:20.570 --> 04:22.450
Urin…

04:22.450 --> 04:26.320
It feels like we haven’t been like this in a long time.

04:28.370 --> 04:30.660
Onee-chan…

04:31.700 --> 04:36.080
I will let you attain a heart of absolute darkness.

04:37.000 --> 04:39.250
It’s all right now.

04:40.210 --> 04:41.300
I don’t want that.

04:43.420 --> 04:49.510
If that happens, the feeling of liking Urin will also disappear.

05:03.940 --> 05:04.610
Urin…

05:05.860 --> 05:11.450
I really want to go and see the Coral Reef with you again.

05:11.450 --> 05:15.040
Things would’ve been better if we’d never seen the corals.

05:16.620 --> 05:21.000
Things would’ve been better if I never called you “Onee-chan.”

05:21.800 --> 05:25.470
Things would’ve been better if I’d never met you.

05:27.050 --> 05:30.470
I disliked you from the start.

05:36.270 --> 05:38.020
If that were so,

05:38.020 --> 05:42.480
then I wouldn’t have to see the sad expression on your face.

05:48.820 --> 05:49.700
Marin…

05:52.030 --> 05:54.290
Urin isn’t here either.

05:54.290 --> 05:56.620
The darkness’s energy is decreasing, too.

05:58.040 --> 05:59.580
Turtle?

06:01.090 --> 06:03.250
Hey, come over here, Turtle.

06:05.800 --> 06:09.010
I can’t do this anymore. I really want to die.

06:09.010 --> 06:11.640
Hey! Hang in there.

06:11.640 --> 06:15.180
Marin and Urin are gone. Let’s look for them.

06:15.180 --> 06:16.810
What?!

06:17.520 --> 06:24.730
But now that Sedona has been revived, you guys have lost your powers as Priestesses.

06:24.730 --> 06:25.940
Turtle…

06:27.780 --> 06:31.700
Sedona’s real body is actually nothing special.

06:33.410 --> 06:36.540
Sedona is ourselves.

06:39.870 --> 06:46.800
Sedona is formed by the little bit of darkness in peoples’ hearts.

06:46.800 --> 06:48.220
No way…

06:48.220 --> 06:52.140
Mom and Kojima, those words they said…

06:52.140 --> 06:53.890
I’m sure it’s not because Sedona affected them.

06:55.350 --> 07:00.440
Those were words that were hidden in their hearts, somewhere.

07:00.440 --> 07:04.320
Inside every person’s heart, there is a little darkness.

07:05.480 --> 07:07.860
It is those sorrows that are washed into the ocean,

07:07.860 --> 07:11.530
just because they are afraid of the darkness in their heart.

07:11.530 --> 07:14.950
So, there is no real form, huh?

07:14.950 --> 07:17.790
All right, Turtle, let’s look for Marin and the others.

07:19.250 --> 07:20.460
Ouch!

07:20.460 --> 07:22.500
Hey! You can’t swim straight or something?

07:22.500 --> 07:24.590
What? Look at yourself!

07:30.090 --> 07:31.590
This is…

07:31.590 --> 07:34.800
Yes. A place that holds our memories.

07:36.470 --> 07:39.980
This is the only way to save Onee-chan…

07:48.530 --> 07:50.190
What are you going to do?

07:50.190 --> 07:55.570
From now on, you will hate me.

07:57.660 --> 08:00.950
Let your heart be invaded by darkness.

08:42.330 --> 08:44.580
So beautiful!

08:46.750 --> 08:47.630
Onee-chan…

08:49.630 --> 08:51.050
Onee-chan.

08:52.970 --> 08:55.470
Urin! I love you!

08:56.970 --> 08:58.850
No…

08:58.850 --> 09:00.260
Stop it, Urin…

09:01.100 --> 09:04.640
At this rate, Onee-chan will die.

09:04.640 --> 09:07.900
Hurry up and get rid of your heart of light.

09:07.900 --> 09:12.440
The only way… is to hate me.

09:14.530 --> 09:16.860
I already don’t care about anything.

09:16.860 --> 09:20.530
Even if I am hated, I won’t feel the sorrow.

09:23.700 --> 09:27.880
The Sea and the Sky are far away, yet approaching each other.

09:28.920 --> 09:32.500
Unable to separate…

09:37.720 --> 09:42.470
That day will come,

09:43.890 --> 09:46.100
because they are together.

09:47.390 --> 09:51.900
Breezes, waves, clouds and trees…

09:51.900 --> 09:55.030
If they can connect the hearts of two people,

09:55.030 --> 09:59.160
I am sure that I can see it again…

09:59.740 --> 10:02.660
Your face, and your lovely smile.

10:03.790 --> 10:12.630
I’m sure Urin’s lovely smile will come back.

10:13.500 --> 10:16.720
I love Urin.

10:17.550 --> 10:22.300
I like the smiling Urin, the mad Urin,

10:22.930 --> 10:28.770
the crying Urin… I like every one of them.

10:30.600 --> 10:33.860
Even if Urin hates me,

10:33.860 --> 10:36.820
no matter who Urin likes,

10:36.820 --> 10:40.160
I cannot hate Urin.

10:41.700 --> 10:42.870
Urin!

10:45.120 --> 10:46.870
I love you…

10:49.250 --> 10:52.670
Since I first met you, I’ve liked you.

10:52.670 --> 10:55.670
Whether it’s now or in the future,

10:55.670 --> 10:58.470
I love you the most.

10:59.630 --> 11:04.600
There is nothing more painful than hating Urin.

11:08.480 --> 11:12.770
Priestess of the Darkness, don’t allow the light to invade you.

11:14.610 --> 11:15.650
Found them…

11:15.650 --> 11:16.780
That is…

11:32.830 --> 11:33.580
Onee-chan…

11:36.250 --> 11:37.880
I’m sorry.

11:44.680 --> 11:47.930
I’m sorry, Onee-chan…

11:47.930 --> 11:50.230
I won’t do anything horrible again.

11:51.180 --> 11:54.440
I actually left a string from a heart of light.

11:55.110 --> 11:58.030
I really like you, too.

11:59.280 --> 12:00.490
Urin!

12:01.280 --> 12:06.700
It seems that when I think about Onee-chan, Sedona feels pain.

12:07.830 --> 12:09.080
Urin, are you all right?!

12:09.080 --> 12:09.790
Don’t come near me!

12:11.580 --> 12:15.250
Don’t come near me… I already understand.

12:16.000 --> 12:20.210
The only one who can seal Sedona… is me…

12:22.760 --> 12:27.600
I just have to think about Onee-chan some more.

12:27.890 --> 12:30.810
Remember the feeling of liking you…

12:31.480 --> 12:33.690
Only if I don’t lose to Sedona…

12:34.690 --> 12:37.520
Am I right, Sedona?

12:37.520 --> 12:40.730
At that moment, you will fall with me.

12:42.900 --> 12:43.780
That’s fine.

12:43.780 --> 12:45.240
Wait, Urin.

12:45.660 --> 12:50.080
You will fall to a place of absolute darkness
where no light will be able to reach.

12:50.080 --> 12:52.200
Do you mean you do not care?

12:52.200 --> 12:56.710
I don’t care. Even if that will happen, I only want to protect Onee-chan.

12:56.710 --> 12:58.790
How foolish.

12:58.790 --> 13:02.380
If the heart of light is completely released,

13:02.380 --> 13:07.260
you will turn into a bubble of light and disappear.

13:09.140 --> 13:11.430
I will disappear.

13:15.810 --> 13:18.610
Even if that happens, I don’t care.

13:19.940 --> 13:21.610
Even if my voice will be unheard,

13:23.150 --> 13:29.660
my smile will be unseen, myself unable to see her again…

13:29.660 --> 13:31.330
Even if that happens, I…

13:37.290 --> 13:39.000
Nice to meet you!

13:42.550 --> 13:44.090
Urin!

13:44.090 --> 13:46.380
Marin! Calm down!

13:46.380 --> 13:51.220
You can’t do this! I don’t want you like this! Come back!

13:51.220 --> 13:52.810
What can we do, Turtle?

13:52.810 --> 13:56.940
Don’t get closer! You guys will get pulled in!

13:56.940 --> 14:00.190
Respect your sister’s decision.

14:00.190 --> 14:01.270
That can’t be.

14:00.190 --> 14:06.650
No! Don’t, Urin! Don’t!

14:06.650 --> 14:11.160
I don’t want you to go! No!

14:11.450 --> 14:19.080
Urin! I want to see the coral reefs with you again!

14:19.080 --> 14:23.630
I want to swim with you again, and walk together…

14:20.080 --> 14:21.460
Onee-chan…

14:23.630 --> 14:28.760
I want to hear you call me Onee-chan once more.

14:29.590 --> 14:33.260
I do, too… I really do.

14:34.560 --> 14:38.310
I really want to be with you again!

14:42.020 --> 14:45.730
I wish to be with Onee-chan again.

14:45.730 --> 14:50.700
I want to hear you say “Urin, I love you” again.

14:51.570 --> 14:52.410
Urin!

14:52.870 --> 14:56.870
I don’t want to say goodbye.

14:57.450 --> 15:00.500
That’s not good! Sedona is…

15:02.290 --> 15:04.420
Urin!

15:05.000 --> 15:07.550
Urin! I don’t want you to go anywhere!

15:08.590 --> 15:10.590
I won’t let you leave me!

15:13.010 --> 15:15.890
Sedona’s energy is weakening.

15:17.140 --> 15:19.940
Wanting to be together again.

15:21.600 --> 15:24.560
Wanting to say “I love you.”

15:25.860 --> 15:30.450
Not really wanting to bid farewell.

15:30.450 --> 15:33.570
I can feel Sedona’s heart.

15:34.870 --> 15:37.790
Those feelings that cannot be gotten past…

15:37.790 --> 15:40.870
Those feelings that are hidden deep inside themselves…

15:40.870 --> 15:42.790
Every type of feeling…

15:43.500 --> 15:47.380
Those are all of our hearts.

15:48.420 --> 15:52.470
The hearts we discarded into the Sea. Our weak hearts.

15:54.050 --> 15:57.100
They’re neither light nor dark.

15:57.510 --> 16:00.600
They’re just ordinary hearts.

16:09.610 --> 16:12.650
The dark has been undone by the light.

16:28.920 --> 16:36.220
The dark and the light forgave each other and returned to being one.

16:36.220 --> 16:42.560
The dark and the light work together to become the hearts of the people.

16:43.190 --> 16:48.480
From now on, even if the darkness invades again,

16:48.480 --> 16:51.070
no matter how many times,

16:51.070 --> 16:54.490
there are many chances to forgive.

16:54.490 --> 16:58.280
The Sky, the Sea…

17:05.040 --> 17:06.630
Onee-chan…

17:06.630 --> 17:09.630
Urin, welcome back.

17:10.590 --> 17:11.550
Kanon…

17:12.920 --> 17:14.470
Welcome back, Urin.

17:24.230 --> 17:26.980
I am so sorry, Corals.

17:26.980 --> 17:31.440
Let’s take care of them together. Let them get well soon.

17:40.240 --> 17:41.620
I had a nice nap.

17:41.620 --> 17:42.830
Yeah.

17:44.580 --> 17:47.420
All right. Let’s return and have a sea grape party!

17:47.420 --> 17:48.710
Great idea!

17:48.710 --> 17:51.340
Let’s go to the underground springs, too!

17:53.340 --> 17:56.380
Kanon-chan, do you want to come with us?

17:57.090 --> 17:58.130
Me?

17:59.090 --> 18:00.180
No.

18:02.600 --> 18:06.980
According to tradition, Sky people should not have contact with Sea people.

18:08.810 --> 18:10.270
Why?!

18:10.270 --> 18:12.480
Those are the rules.

18:13.190 --> 18:16.990
The memories of people who were invaded by Sedona’s darkness

18:16.990 --> 18:21.530
will be remembered as being only dreams.

18:22.370 --> 18:25.120
Other than the people who have the bloodline of Priestesses, of course.

18:26.710 --> 18:27.750
Dreams?

18:27.750 --> 18:33.250
Right. Last night, I dreamt I was fighting Kanon.

18:34.050 --> 18:35.840
I was fighting Marin…

18:39.470 --> 18:41.300
Such a weird dream.

18:41.300 --> 18:42.260
That’s right.

18:42.260 --> 18:44.220
That’d never happen.

18:46.020 --> 18:48.600
Some memories are better left forgotten.

18:49.230 --> 18:53.900
But… that means I cannot see Kanon-chan again.

18:53.900 --> 18:55.530
More or less, yeah.

18:58.400 --> 19:02.620
Well, that’s fine. It should have been like this from the start.

19:02.620 --> 19:05.910
It’s better not to have a talking turtle walking around my house.

19:05.910 --> 19:06.870
It’s too much trouble.

19:08.330 --> 19:09.910
Can you leave your turtle shell with us?

19:10.790 --> 19:13.080
You evil aura is returning!

19:13.080 --> 19:15.800
Correct. I am evil.

19:17.880 --> 19:19.130
Take care.

19:21.380 --> 19:23.050
Oh, right.

19:25.760 --> 19:29.230
Here. The ring you left in my care.

19:32.650 --> 19:36.190
This was the start of everything…

19:36.190 --> 19:37.280
Kanon!

19:38.110 --> 19:42.110
I have a lot of things to thank you for…

19:42.820 --> 19:44.200
It’s nothing… So do I.

19:47.160 --> 19:50.910
We’ll be going now. Bye.

19:50.910 --> 19:52.370
Goodbye, Kanon-chan.

19:53.250 --> 19:54.630
Bye.

19:58.050 --> 20:02.720
Nevertheless, both of you are very special Priestesses.

20:04.890 --> 20:07.060
If there are people like the two of you,

20:07.060 --> 20:13.140
the day will come when the rules separating the Sky and the Sea will change.

20:14.600 --> 20:17.570
All right. Sisters, let’s go now.

20:17.570 --> 20:18.610
Okay.

20:21.610 --> 20:23.070
Kanon-chan…

20:23.950 --> 20:25.410
I love you!

20:25.410 --> 20:29.790
Marin, I… I love…

21:10.970 --> 21:12.020
Marin!

21:18.330 --> 21:19.210
Marin…

21:24.420 --> 21:26.010
I love you, Marin!

21:38.270 --> 21:42.480
I love you!

21:52.290 --> 21:53.240
Good morning.

21:53.750 --> 21:55.290
Good morning.

21:57.620 --> 21:59.580
Eh? Oceanology?

22:00.840 --> 22:03.590
But I thought you hated the ocean.

22:04.880 --> 22:06.670
That was before I met Marin…

22:09.050 --> 22:13.770
Which reminds me, I haven’t done any club activities.

22:13.770 --> 22:15.100
Oh?

22:22.520 --> 22:23.900
What’s wrong?

22:24.400 --> 22:28.320
Don’t look at me. This distance is all right.

22:29.110 --> 22:30.700
I understand…

22:32.370 --> 22:33.410
Why?

22:33.410 --> 22:35.200
I’m embarrassed.

22:37.080 --> 22:38.620
Miyamori, how would you feel about me–

22:38.620 --> 22:39.460
I like you.

22:40.670 --> 22:42.840
Of course, saying it out loud is embarrassing…

22:43.200 --> 22:44.310
You said it!

22:44.880 --> 22:45.710
I heard it.

22:45.730 --> 22:46.710
What?

22:47.220 --> 22:49.550
Um, I think I misheard you just now…

22:49.550 --> 22:50.220
Once more?

22:50.220 --> 22:51.840
How many times do you want me to say it?!

22:52.530 --> 22:53.250
But…

22:53.260 --> 22:54.720
You go first! Say it!

22:55.850 --> 22:57.140
But…

22:57.140 --> 23:01.060
Why are you confessing on the first day of school?

23:01.060 --> 23:02.080
Ooshima…

23:02.060 --> 23:06.940
Oh well, the contest has just begun.

23:08.860 --> 23:11.700
Mama, let’s go to the pool.

23:11.700 --> 23:13.370
Next year.

23:13.370 --> 23:15.910
Summer is already ending?

23:15.910 --> 23:18.500
Yes, it ended.

23:18.500 --> 23:22.210
Our last summer vacation of high school just ended.

23:22.210 --> 23:22.920
Yeah.

23:27.090 --> 23:31.680
But I’ll never forget this summer.

23:33.760 --> 23:38.520
Loving you forever

23:34.850 --> 23:36.180
Ever.
